{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"筲箕灣道水管爆裂　玻璃窗被水沖破濺傷女院友\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/BURST-SKW-261027-12.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】筲箕灣有水管爆裂。</p><p>水不斷從地底的水管湧出，附近餐廳的雜物被沖倒，商戶加緊清理積水，並用發泡膠箱擋水，車輛要涉水而行。</p><p>事發在早上10時許，筲箕灣道318號對出，路政署路邊工地旁邊地底有水管爆裂。一間院舍的玻璃窗懷疑被水沖破，碎片濺傷一名女院友，由救護車送往東區醫院治理。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:02:20.231798+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:14:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:18:27.258958+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:58:45.411469+00:00","content_hash":"4e7f77a5d762717c3674794169ab217540e3895554b565517dd5e95c77deff58","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:02:20.231798+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}